1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:02,370
Cinderella

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:11,140
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:20,200
Cinderella's Sister

4
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:25,610
So it's my house in May 2020 right now?

5
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:32,450
Around then, we have to bring Mom over to live next to us.

6
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:37,460
Hyo Seon should also be married by then.

7
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:43,600
Mom won't have anyone to torment, so she'll feel empty inside.

8
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:47,920
We'll bring her over, and let her annoy us.

9
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:51,500
It'll take around ten years to buy a house.

10
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:56,070
We should be able to do it if we tighten our belts.

11
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:06,090
You feel uneasy right now, don't you?

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,310
All you can think about is your dad, right?

13
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:18,380
I thought that would be the case, so I wanted to calm you down before letting you go.

14
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:22,660
I feel peaceful now.

15
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:25,000
Is that so?

16
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,140
This...has given me strength.

17
00:01:30,470 --> 00:01:34,550
- Really?
- Yes, like a big army to my rescue.

18
00:01:34,550 --> 00:01:38,300
If you go back on your words in the future... you know the consequences.

19
00:01:40,970 --> 00:01:47,800
Your father will be all over the news and newspapers.

20
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,400
I know.

21
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:53,250
Hyo Seon will also find out soon.

22
00:01:53,250 --> 00:01:58,480
Right. I'll tell her before she finds out.

23
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:03,470
I kept missing my chances to tell her like I did with you. I can't let her find out from someone else.

24
00:02:04,940 --> 00:02:07,410
Do you know what?

25
00:02:07,410 --> 00:02:11,710
I was always afraid of the things I had to deal with.

26
00:02:11,710 --> 00:02:14,800
Now, I'm not afraid of anything.

27
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:19,260
- Really?
- Really.

28
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:23,680
I can handle it well. I'll get through it.

29
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,750
Whether it's about my dad or Hong Joo Ga,

30
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:32,070
and even telling Hyo Seon. I'll get through it all.

31
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:39,930
Let's go. Let's go reveal who I am to Hyo Seon.

32
00:02:54,210 --> 00:02:59,470
Ahjusshis, I know you've worked hard all this time.

33
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:03,630
Seeing how things aren't doing so great right now, I've prepared these hiking outfits for each of you,

34
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:07,920
so we can go hiking together. But wait and see.

35
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:11,680
I seem like someone who doesn't know gratitude, right?

36
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:15,610
But if I set my mind to repay my gratitude, I'll definitely do it.

37
00:03:15,610 --> 00:03:21,320
Just watch and see what the owner of Dae Seong True Winemakers is like.

38
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:24,190
Just work hard as you have been doing. Just like you're doing now.

39
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:26,050
Understand?

40
00:03:26,890 --> 00:03:29,420
Hurry and get back to work.

41
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:59,070
Uncle, Mom says she wants to see you.

42
00:04:09,490 --> 00:04:16,100
Hyo Seon, can you tell me what she wants to say ahead of time?

43
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:21,890
You see, she and I, you see...

44
00:04:21,890 --> 00:04:27,960
it's a bit... you know... for us to see each other face to face.

45
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,700
It's okay, Uncle. It's okay.

46
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:32,840
Just hurry and go.

47
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,700
Aigoo. Hyo Seon, this is...

48
00:04:57,090 --> 00:05:01,410
Don't worry. Go in, Uncle.

49
00:05:01,410 --> 00:05:05,290
Remember, I've got your back.

50
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:09,900
Just trust me and go in.

51
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:12,930
A-All right, Hyo Seon.

52
00:05:12,930 --> 00:05:17,680
I...You grew up riding on my back. You remember that, right?

53
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:20,220
You never wanted to get off of my back.

54
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:24,850
I'm a little hunchbacked because of that!

55
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:29,050
Don't worry and go see Mom, Uncle.

56
00:05:29,050 --> 00:05:32,070
All right.

57
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,240
Hyo Seon.

58
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:13,660
Hyo Seon.

59
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:15,880
Although we live in one house, it's been a while since we last saw each other.

60
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:17,880
You're right.

61
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,050
You guys came back together?

62
00:06:21,050 --> 00:06:23,720
There's something I want to tell you.

63
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,350
Let's go in.

64
00:06:27,260 --> 00:06:29,250
Mr. Hong Gi Hoon.

65
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:43,800
(Prosecutor's Badge)

66
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:48,710
- You're aware that Hong Joo Ga's Chairman Hong Han Seok is being investigated by the prosecutor's office, right?
- Yes.

67
00:06:48,710 --> 00:06:53,960
It's been discovered that there's a slush fund of a huge amount deposited in your bank account.

68
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:56,580
I think you need to come with us.

69
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:58,550
What did you say?

70
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:07,440
- I'll be back.
- What happened?

71
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:11,680
Where...where are you going?

72
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,980
I'm not sure if it will be long or not, but I'll be back.

73
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:18,260
Don't worry and just wait for me.

74
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:21,950
What is it? Who are those people?

75
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:27,430
I told you I'll handle things well.

76
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:30,310
It seems there's something else I have to handle now.

77
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:33,030
It's okay, I can handle it.

78
00:07:33,030 --> 00:07:36,120
Who are those people?

79
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,730
Excuse me.

80
00:07:37,730 --> 00:07:39,710
They're prosecutors.

81
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:45,400
I said I'll handle it. It's all right.

82
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:49,130
Help me tell Hyo Seon.

83
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:55,480
Tell her everything from the beginning.

84
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:59,500
Don't hide anything and tell her everything.

85
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:01,430
Please do it for me.

86
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:04,060
What are you saying?

87
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:08,320
Hide what? What are you asking her to do?

88
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:11,980
What did prosecutors come to find you?

89
00:08:11,980 --> 00:08:14,040
I'll be back.

90
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:20,210
I'll be back.

91
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:36,050
Wait!

92
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,830
Wait!

93
00:08:44,410 --> 00:08:47,530
Wait! Wait a moment!

94
00:08:48,050 --> 00:08:50,940
Open the door! I have something to say!

95
00:08:50,940 --> 00:08:53,360
Open the door!

96
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:16,030
Why aren't you coming in? Do I need to come out?

97
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:24,760
Sit.

98
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:27,460
I'm...fine here.

99
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:32,170
Just sit! How many times do I have to ask?

100
00:09:37,210 --> 00:09:44,400
You know I don't even want to see your face at all, right?

101
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:48,290
I'm asking you a question, so respond!

102
00:09:48,290 --> 00:09:52,150
Y-Yes... I know.

103
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:54,530
You also probably feel the same as me.

104
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:57,430
You don't want to see me even for a moment, right?

105
00:09:57,430 --> 00:10:01,160
That...that's right, yes.

106
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:08,330
Even though I want to kick you out right away, that brat, Hyo Seon will make a fuss again.

107
00:10:08,330 --> 00:10:12,560
Then she'll bother the elders and make it into a big problem.

108
00:10:14,310 --> 00:10:16,300
Look here, Uncle.

109
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:19,080
Where should I look?

110
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:24,620
The most peaceful way for us to go our separate ways

111
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:27,590
is for you to get married.

112
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:35,500
No...but...I need to have a girlfriend for that to happen...

113
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:39,100
Even if I have a girlfriend, I need to have money or some assets...

114
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:41,350
Even if I do...the girl...

115
00:10:41,350 --> 00:10:47,430
No...so...it's impossible for that to happen in a short time...

116
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:56,330
This is my old friend's distant relative. Try meeting her.

117
00:10:57,190 --> 00:11:03,380
I... If I leave this place, I have nowhere to go.

118
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:09,490
I don't have any savings, and I've really got nothing to my name.

119
00:11:09,490 --> 00:11:13,280
And I wouldn't know how to make a living in the city.

120
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:17,910
So I'm pleading for forgiveness.

121
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:20,770
I've really reflected on myself.

122
00:11:20,770 --> 00:11:22,720
Just look at the picture!

123
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,550
Okay...

124
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:43,330
If I just send you away with nothing, Hyo Seon will cause a commotion,

125
00:11:44,050 --> 00:11:45,990
and even if not her,

126
00:11:45,990 --> 00:11:51,770
I can't ignore how much Hyo Seon's father thought of you so

127
00:11:51,770 --> 00:11:56,270
I can give you what you need to start off,

128
00:11:56,270 --> 00:12:02,450
but after that, don't even expect a single thing from this family.

129
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:06,880
If you have a conscience, you'll understand that, right?

130
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:37,790
I can't believe it.

131
00:12:40,610 --> 00:12:43,320
Oppa Gi Hoon did that?

132
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:49,400
Oppa Gi Hoon headed the plan to ruin Dad?

133
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:54,560
Are you asking me to believe that?

134
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:57,870
You're seriously asking me to believe you?

135
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:02,080
What is with you guys?

136
00:13:03,270 --> 00:13:08,570
What are you guys plotting?

137
00:13:08,570 --> 00:13:13,590
I...have a headache, Hyo Seon.

138
00:13:13,590 --> 00:13:17,910
Don't be agitated. There's still more I have to say.

139
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:26,040
You...You're trying to take revenge on me, aren't you?

140
00:13:28,610 --> 00:13:33,170
Because I didn't give you that letter and hid it from you,

141
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:37,490
so now you're trying to take revenge on me, right?

142
00:13:37,490 --> 00:13:41,700
You think I'll get hurt

143
00:13:43,190 --> 00:13:46,820
if you denigrate the man I've always liked, don't you?

144
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:55,650
You want to humiliate me for being attracted to the man

145
00:13:56,370 --> 00:13:59,350
who tried to ruin my dad, right?

146
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:03,210
I can't stand it!

147
00:14:03,210 --> 00:14:09,570
I really can't stand someone like you!

148
00:14:09,570 --> 00:14:13,820
How in the world did I spend the last eight years

149
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:17,630
begging and crying for your love?

150
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:22,410
I feel wronged.

151
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:28,400
How can you ... how can you do this to me

152
00:14:30,010 --> 00:14:37,220
for a mistake of hiding one measly letter?

153
00:14:43,010 --> 00:14:44,950
Hyo Seon.

154
00:14:48,490 --> 00:14:56,840
Do you know how my life changed ever since you appeared?

155
00:14:57,720 --> 00:15:03,590
Dad had all his attention on you, and only had eyes for you,

156
00:15:03,590 --> 00:15:06,610
so I had to share my dad with you.

157
00:15:06,610 --> 00:15:13,350
On top of that, suddenly, for some unknown reason,

158
00:15:13,350 --> 00:15:18,610
I can no longer see my dad now.

159
00:15:18,610 --> 00:15:23,980
I even found out that Mom's love for me was fake,

160
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:28,750
and that Mom betrayed Dad.

161
00:15:28,750 --> 00:15:31,230
Because I still couldn't give up even a mother like that,

162
00:15:31,230 --> 00:15:35,780
I could only cry pathetically.

163
00:15:37,020 --> 00:15:39,850
And finally, because I'm only a stepdaughter,

164
00:15:39,850 --> 00:15:47,230
when I was told that I can be treated only as well as a stepdaughter, I had to act grateful.

165
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:53,930
But now, it's Oppa Gi Hoon?

166
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:59,540
Oppa did what?

167
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:02,010
What did he do?

168
00:16:14,150 --> 00:16:16,190
Hyo Seon.

169
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:19,750
Don't touch me.

170
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,180
Hyo Seon.

171
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,620
Hyo Seon!

172
00:16:40,490 --> 00:16:44,630
I'm asking within the things you've lost at home, is there something you've never been able to find?

173
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:49,800
Since you're mine, you can't get married to anyone. Okay?

174
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:58,520
My heart is thumping, Oppa.

175
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:03,660
♫ when I wake up from an exhausted sleep  ♫

176
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:08,870
Let's send Ahjusshi off properly.

177
00:17:08,870 --> 00:17:14,170
♫ because I still remember you smiling ♫

178
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:19,250
Hyo Seon!

179
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:25,020
Hyo Seon!

180
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:26,750
Hyo Seon, are you okay?

181
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:29,530
Hyo Seon!

182
00:17:29,530 --> 00:17:34,740
Hyo Seon! Hyo Seon!

183
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:37,340
- Let go!
- Hyo Seon.

184
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:39,710
Don't touch me!

185
00:17:39,710 --> 00:17:43,840
Hyo Seon!

186
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:46,670
♫ I walk this street again ♫

187
00:17:46,670 --> 00:17:49,690
It's okay. It's okay.

188
00:17:49,690 --> 00:17:56,700
♫ I am living day after day  ♫

189
00:17:56,700 --> 00:18:05,770
♫ In your name when tears appear, ah ♫

190
00:18:05,770 --> 00:18:08,280
♫ I can't bear it ♫

191
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:13,080
♫ So I can't laugh ♫

192
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:23,780
♫ I'll call out your name again ♫

193
00:18:33,230 --> 00:18:35,880
There's still more I have to tell you.

194
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:45,460
I've thought hard about whether it's right to tell you, or if I should tell you later.

195
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:54,020
But I think it's better to feel the pain all at once.

196
00:18:56,990 --> 00:19:01,790
That person...and I...

197
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:04,030
Unni...

198
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:10,250
Oppa Gi Hoon...

199
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:16,690
is so pitiful.

200
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:25,760
I want to give him a hug.

201
00:19:33,190 --> 00:19:39,440
When Dad first brought Gi Hoon here,

202
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:46,870
he said he was someone he wanted to take care of.

203
00:19:46,870 --> 00:19:50,220
He's someone that shines like a jade,

204
00:19:50,220 --> 00:19:54,990
but he's becoming fragile like glass,

205
00:19:56,030 --> 00:19:59,930
We have to take care of him so he doesn't break,

206
00:20:00,750 --> 00:20:07,600
so help me do that too, Hyo Seon.

207
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:09,940
That's what Dad said.

208
00:20:12,010 --> 00:20:19,740
If he hadn't left and stayed with Dad the whole time,

209
00:20:24,010 --> 00:20:26,820
he wouldn't have shattered.

210
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,500
How many pieces

211
00:20:33,530 --> 00:20:36,520
did he shatter into?

212
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:39,170
Our Oppa Gi Hoon...

213
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:47,600
If I said I'll put the pieces together for him,

214
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:54,540
would he let me?

215
00:21:01,210 --> 00:21:07,710
Tell him not to run away.

216
00:21:09,280 --> 00:21:12,390
Once he sees my face,

217
00:21:14,270 --> 00:21:17,960
he may not be able to face me,

218
00:21:19,630 --> 00:21:23,100
and run away,

219
00:21:23,100 --> 00:21:28,090
so help me tell him, Unni.

220
00:21:31,520 --> 00:21:36,030
Tell him not to run away.

221
00:21:38,520 --> 00:21:44,600
Are fairytales not suited for me after all?

222
00:21:52,350 --> 00:21:55,490
No, I didn't know.

223
00:21:55,490 --> 00:21:59,800
It's my first time hearing I have such an account.

224
00:21:59,800 --> 00:22:06,310
Every year, there was activity of billions to even ten billions of won in that account. You didn't know at all?

225
00:22:06,310 --> 00:22:08,560
I didn't.

226
00:22:08,560 --> 00:22:11,930
I never even imagined it.

227
00:22:11,930 --> 00:22:13,790
But as an employee of Hong Joo Ga...

228
00:22:13,790 --> 00:22:17,280
Am I not allowed to have a gentle, sweet,

229
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:20,150
relaxing and beautiful

230
00:22:20,150 --> 00:22:24,950
world of fairytales?

231
00:22:24,950 --> 00:22:30,060
How is my father doing?

232
00:22:31,580 --> 00:22:36,110
Could you let me see him even just for a bit?

233
00:22:37,770 --> 00:22:43,570
It's not like I want to rewrite the rules of the universe

234
00:22:43,570 --> 00:22:46,440
or save the world,

235
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:50,460
Nor am I trying to save the country...

236
00:22:56,600 --> 00:23:01,200
Hello? Is this Prosecutor Kim Hyeong Man?

237
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:05,140
I'm Goo Eun Jo, Hong Gi Hoon's friend who called you before.

238
00:23:05,140 --> 00:23:08,490
Is it not possible for me to see him?

239
00:23:09,690 --> 00:23:15,210
Then...when will I be able to see him? Can I not even see him for a little bit?

240
00:23:15,900 --> 00:23:18,450
Wait...Wait a minute.

241
00:23:18,450 --> 00:23:21,010
Wait, please don't hang up.

242
00:23:21,740 --> 00:23:25,600
There's...There's something I have to say to him.

243
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:28,230
Can you pass a message to him?

244
00:23:29,760 --> 00:23:34,690
I wanted to tell him I am waiting for him.

245
00:23:35,490 --> 00:23:42,150
N-Never mind. Sorry.

246
00:23:42,150 --> 00:23:47,050
There's nothing I want to say. Sorry.

247
00:24:03,090 --> 00:24:08,760
I still haven't been able to call that person's name.

248
00:24:09,870 --> 00:24:15,980
So...I just wanted to live and be able to call his name.

249
00:24:17,140 --> 00:24:20,940
Is it really that wrong?

250
00:24:34,940 --> 00:24:37,940
Song Eun Jo is forever Han Jeong Woo's woman

251
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:48,190
Try throwing it. I taught you.

252
00:24:48,190 --> 00:24:50,490
Throw with all your might, punk.

253
00:24:54,480 --> 00:24:56,450
One more time.

254
00:25:02,460 --> 00:25:04,510
Come on, one more time.

255
00:26:10,970 --> 00:26:15,220
Your conversation will be recorded and logged.

256
00:26:15,220 --> 00:26:19,080
I understand. Thank you.

257
00:26:20,720 --> 00:26:26,240
Who would've guessed we'd end up meeting here.

258
00:26:29,180 --> 00:26:31,220
Are you okay?

259
00:26:32,510 --> 00:26:34,800
How do I seem?

260
00:26:34,800 --> 00:26:37,200
It must be hard on you.

261
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:39,140
It's not easy.

262
00:26:39,140 --> 00:26:46,120
Is it harder to hold on than it is to let go, Father?

263
00:26:46,990 --> 00:26:49,070
How are you doing?

264
00:26:49,070 --> 00:26:51,500
It's easy for me.

265
00:26:51,500 --> 00:26:57,560
I just have to say what I know, and tell them I don't know to things I don't know.

266
00:26:59,790 --> 00:27:01,750
Dad.

267
00:27:03,130 --> 00:27:06,070
I want to live with you, Dad.

268
00:27:08,470 --> 00:27:10,640
I really mean it.

269
00:27:13,410 --> 00:27:21,960
There are many times when I wished that you were simply my father.

270
00:27:24,340 --> 00:27:30,160
I know what will happen if you admit everything.

271
00:27:31,410 --> 00:27:34,050
You'll have to go to prison,

272
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:41,640
and it's hard to predict how long you'll have to spend in there.

273
00:27:43,340 --> 00:27:50,500
In others' eyes, it may seem immoral for a son to ask his father to go to prison,

274
00:27:50,500 --> 00:27:53,080
but I'll wait for you.

275
00:27:53,990 --> 00:28:02,150
I'll wait, along with a pretty brat. We'll take care of you, get a house ready and wait for you.

276
00:28:03,500 --> 00:28:08,560
That brat also promised she would do that.

277
00:28:10,280 --> 00:28:17,990
Don't cling onto anything else other than me, okay?

278
00:29:11,780 --> 00:29:18,470
The elders have decided not to sell their shares to Hong Joo Ga.

279
00:29:18,470 --> 00:29:23,740
They've even gotten back the shares they had already sold.

280
00:29:23,740 --> 00:29:25,240
Really?

281
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:29,660
I just got the call from them. What happened?

282
00:29:31,470 --> 00:29:33,830
They must've seen the news reports.

283
00:29:34,660 --> 00:29:40,860
I...I feel anxious.

284
00:29:41,750 --> 00:29:45,660
Do you think Oppa Gi Hoon knows this?

285
00:29:45,660 --> 00:29:50,660
If he knows, he'll probably feel less burdened.

286
00:29:51,800 --> 00:29:58,230
Then he'll feel more at ease while being interrogated.

287
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:04,940
I'm going to go to Seoul to see Oppa Gi Hoon tomorrow morning.

288
00:30:06,510 --> 00:30:11,230
Do you want to come with me?

289
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:17,530
Can you come with me?

290
00:30:17,530 --> 00:30:24,600
If he sees me first, it'll be hard on him.

291
00:30:42,890 --> 00:30:44,820
Hyo Seon.

292
00:30:47,540 --> 00:30:50,030
What if...

293
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:57,610
What I'm saying is...I...

294
00:31:00,280 --> 00:31:06,360
What if I only think of myself and just do what I want?

295
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:08,960
I wanted to ask that.

296
00:31:13,340 --> 00:31:18,790
But...in front of this child that I had taken everything from,

297
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:24,040
this child that has nothing left of her own,

298
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:28,720
I held back and couldn't say it.

299
00:31:28,720 --> 00:31:30,590
Okay.

300
00:31:33,020 --> 00:31:35,290
I'll go with you.

301
00:31:41,820 --> 00:31:43,840
Thanks.

302
00:32:16,750 --> 00:32:21,060
Gosh, what is going on with him suddenly?

303
00:32:21,060 --> 00:32:25,670
It's great that I saw you.

304
00:32:25,670 --> 00:32:29,280
Jeong Woo told me to give this to Joon Soo's eldest noona.

305
00:32:30,940 --> 00:32:35,610
Why is that kid, without any notice... without any loyalty... doing something like this all of a sudden?

306
00:32:35,610 --> 00:32:39,530
Aigoo. He just left.

307
00:32:40,810 --> 00:32:44,020
No matter where I am, no matter where Noona is,

308
00:32:44,020 --> 00:32:47,820
you're the only woman in my heart.

309
00:32:47,820 --> 00:32:50,800
No matter what you do, I'll support you.

310
00:32:50,800 --> 00:32:53,880
If you need me, I'll run to you anytime.

311
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:55,800
Remember this.

312
00:32:57,340 --> 00:32:59,440
Where did he say he's going?

313
00:32:59,440 --> 00:33:03,070
Which way did he go?

314
00:33:08,230 --> 00:33:10,040
Jeong Woo.

315
00:33:29,720 --> 00:33:31,840
Juwon Road

316
00:33:31,840 --> 00:33:38,130
Jeong Woo! Jeong Woo! Jeong Woo!

317
00:33:38,130 --> 00:33:40,740
Don't run! You'll get hurt!

318
00:33:40,740 --> 00:33:42,400
Jeong Woo!

319
00:33:46,330 --> 00:33:49,850
Why do you run like that? You'll all out of breath.

320
00:33:49,850 --> 00:33:52,770
Where are you going? Do you have a place to go?

321
00:33:52,770 --> 00:33:55,630
- Are you leaving because you have somewhere to go?
- Don't worry.

322
00:33:55,630 --> 00:33:59,070
I have lots of places I can go. The only problem is that no one wants me to come.

323
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:03,780
Stop playing around. Let's go home.

324
00:34:18,450 --> 00:34:21,030
I wanted to do this at least once.

325
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:24,390
But I didn't dare.

326
00:34:26,420 --> 00:34:30,550
If I release you now, you'll probably hit me.

327
00:34:33,450 --> 00:34:37,070
It's okay. I'll let you hit me before I leave.

328
00:34:41,310 --> 00:34:43,330
Be well.

329
00:34:45,450 --> 00:34:49,760
Thank you for coming to see me off.

330
00:34:53,600 --> 00:34:58,490
I won't starve. Don't worry about me.

331
00:35:02,310 --> 00:35:06,780
If you're not doing well, I'll know right away.

332
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:12,250
If you need me, I'll come right away.

333
00:35:15,340 --> 00:35:21,160
Make sure you don't make me drop whatever I'm doing and run here right away

334
00:35:22,340 --> 00:35:24,620
so you have to be well, okay?

335
00:35:32,740 --> 00:35:35,380
How can I let you go like this?

336
00:35:35,380 --> 00:35:40,590
I haven't done anything for you yet. Leave some other time.

337
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:44,210
Let Noona give you a bank account with plenty of earned interest.

338
00:35:44,210 --> 00:35:48,980
And until I'm able to do something for you,

339
00:35:48,980 --> 00:35:51,790
Go then, okay?

340
00:35:53,660 --> 00:35:55,940
You keep it.

341
00:35:57,480 --> 00:36:03,890
If you need it, use it. If you don't, then just keep making it grow.

342
00:36:05,870 --> 00:36:11,040
Wherever I go, I am with you. Got it?

343
00:36:11,040 --> 00:36:13,660
♫ Looking only in this direction ♫

344
00:36:13,660 --> 00:36:17,530
♫ my two eyes ♫

345
00:36:18,490 --> 00:36:21,920
♫ can't say they waited for you  ♫

346
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:24,490
Jeong Woo!

347
00:36:24,490 --> 00:36:31,110
♫ I can't say I'm coming back  ♫

348
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:36,700
♫ Will you who knows everthing about me  ♫

349
00:36:36,700 --> 00:36:39,480
♫  who cannot forget you ♫

350
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:42,330
♫  return to me? ♫

351
00:36:42,330 --> 00:36:47,930
♫  If there are tens of thousand who will just love you ♫

352
00:36:47,930 --> 00:36:53,630
♫  If I can always look at you ♫

353
00:36:53,630 --> 00:36:56,920
♫  The day I return to your side again ♫

354
00:36:56,920 --> 00:37:01,650
I could just leave like that.

355
00:37:03,470 --> 00:37:06,590
It's not something that difficult.

356
00:37:06,590 --> 00:37:14,580
I could just simply leave with a smile, just like Jeong Woo.

357
00:37:37,460 --> 00:37:41,230
You can rely on me.

358
00:37:43,610 --> 00:37:46,260
Lean on me.

359
00:37:46,260 --> 00:37:51,560
You lean on me now, okay?

360
00:38:03,490 --> 00:38:06,040
Incoming call
...

361
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:23,920
Incoming call
...

362
00:38:31,760 --> 00:38:35,410
I'm coming home now.

363
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:39,830
My interrogation is over, and I'm coming to you.

364
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:45,350
Eun Jo?

365
00:38:47,090 --> 00:38:51,880
Eun Jo. Eun Jo.

366
00:38:51,880 --> 00:38:54,360
Are you listening?

367
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:56,190
Eun Jo.

368
00:38:58,470 --> 00:39:03,610
Yes. I'm listening.

369
00:39:03,610 --> 00:39:06,250
Why aren't you talking, brat?

370
00:39:06,250 --> 00:39:09,320
I missed hearing your voice so much.

371
00:39:11,960 --> 00:39:13,970
I did well.

372
00:39:14,780 --> 00:39:19,130
I got through it all by thinking of you.

373
00:39:19,130 --> 00:39:21,310
Praise me.

374
00:39:24,090 --> 00:39:28,870
I told you to praise me, you brat. Tell me I did well.

375
00:39:31,570 --> 00:39:35,920
You did well.

376
00:39:37,270 --> 00:39:40,040
I also saw my dad.

377
00:39:40,040 --> 00:39:46,440
I even grabbed his hand.

378
00:39:47,270 --> 00:39:52,450
You did really well.

379
00:39:53,450 --> 00:39:57,850
I grabbed his hand tightly.

380
00:39:59,380 --> 00:40:04,660
You did really well.

381
00:40:05,690 --> 00:40:07,620
Eun Jo.

382
00:40:10,500 --> 00:40:12,140
Yeah?

383
00:40:12,890 --> 00:40:15,070
I want to see you.

384
00:40:19,990 --> 00:40:21,970
Yes.

385
00:40:21,970 --> 00:40:25,790
I'm coming to you now.

386
00:40:34,520 --> 00:40:36,430
Eun Jo.

387
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,980
Yes?

388
00:40:42,950 --> 00:40:45,320
I'm hungry.

389
00:40:50,790 --> 00:40:52,540
Okay.

390
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:56,400
I'm coming to you now,

391
00:40:58,480 --> 00:41:01,260
my stupid brat.

392
00:42:52,290 --> 00:42:56,480
Please take care of Hyo Seon.

393
00:43:06,570 --> 00:43:12,190
Unni abandoned me and left.

394
00:43:20,230 --> 00:43:23,620
Please tell me, I beg of you.

395
00:43:29,480 --> 00:43:31,160
I don't know.

396
00:43:31,160 --> 00:43:34,070
Have you ever heard of anyone running away and saying where they're going?

397
00:43:34,070 --> 00:43:36,960
Eun Jo and I made a promise.

398
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:40,850
I can't understand her reason for doing this so suddenly.

399
00:43:40,850 --> 00:43:44,940
You know where Eun Jo went, right?

400
00:43:44,940 --> 00:43:49,110
I...I said I don't know!

401
00:43:57,460 --> 00:44:00,060
Few months later

402
00:44:05,470 --> 00:44:07,980
I already told you. Don't you listen when I speak?

403
00:44:07,980 --> 00:44:09,800
Hey! Mr. Kim! Mr. Kim!

404
00:44:09,800 --> 00:44:14,690
Mr. Kim! You've all worked hard. Finish things up here well.

405
00:44:18,670 --> 00:44:21,240
Are you sure?

406
00:44:21,240 --> 00:44:24,700
Is it for sure this time?

407
00:44:24,700 --> 00:44:27,890
I wasn't the one who saw it, so it's hard to say.

408
00:44:27,890 --> 00:44:31,400
Our classmate, Jang Hye Rin, has a sister who attended the same university as your sister.

409
00:44:31,400 --> 00:44:34,000
It seems she heard it somewhere.

410
00:44:34,000 --> 00:44:36,690
She said she clearly heard the name Goo Eun Jo.

411
00:44:38,360 --> 00:44:41,250
Okay. I understand, Unni. I'm hanging up.

412
00:44:41,250 --> 00:44:43,930
I'll call you later.

413
00:45:08,920 --> 00:45:12,880
The person named Goo Eun Jo isn't a woman?

414
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:15,980
No. I'm Goo Eun Jo.

415
00:45:15,980 --> 00:45:19,730
Your name is really Goo Eun Jo?

416
00:45:19,730 --> 00:45:21,350
Yes, that's what I said.

417
00:45:21,350 --> 00:45:26,330
Look, this is my gown. "Goo Eun Jo". See?

418
00:45:26,330 --> 00:45:28,550
Goo Eun Jo

419
00:45:31,190 --> 00:45:35,220
All right. Sorry for the trouble.

420
00:45:51,890 --> 00:45:53,850
Oppa.

421
00:45:53,850 --> 00:45:55,550
Yes?

422
00:45:55,550 --> 00:45:59,790
Oppa, perhaps...

423
00:45:59,790 --> 00:46:01,570
Yes?

424
00:46:01,570 --> 00:46:07,290
Did you make some promise with Unni?

425
00:46:10,380 --> 00:46:14,520
It's okay. Tell me.

426
00:46:16,160 --> 00:46:20,900
When I asked to start over like to the first day you came to our house

427
00:46:20,900 --> 00:46:24,610
and you accepted without saying anything,

428
00:46:24,610 --> 00:46:30,870
I already knew that you and I weren't thinking about the same thing.

429
00:46:33,060 --> 00:46:38,360
Is there some promise between you two?

430
00:46:40,930 --> 00:46:42,640
Yes.

431
00:46:50,650 --> 00:46:53,040
But...

432
00:46:54,450 --> 00:47:01,730
why didn't you tell me from the start when I asked to start over?

433
00:47:02,590 --> 00:47:04,880
Because I had to think.

434
00:47:06,710 --> 00:47:09,190
About what?

435
00:47:09,190 --> 00:47:14,540
In her letter, Eun Jo told me to take care of you.

436
00:47:15,920 --> 00:47:19,280
I wasn't sure what she meant by take care of you.

437
00:47:19,280 --> 00:47:24,200
I kept thinking and thinking, so I couldn't say it.

438
00:47:24,200 --> 00:47:30,100
I wasn't sure if it meant to protect and help you until Eun Jo is back,

439
00:47:30,100 --> 00:47:32,350
- or...
- Oppa.

440
00:47:34,840 --> 00:47:37,060
Stop talking.

441
00:47:40,620 --> 00:47:42,880
You can stop now.

442
00:47:45,230 --> 00:47:49,710
That's enough. I understand now.

443
00:47:53,480 --> 00:48:00,270
Let's find Eun Jo, with our every effort.

444
00:48:00,270 --> 00:48:06,750
Instead of searching separately, let's put together our efforts to find her.

445
00:48:06,750 --> 00:48:09,850
Don't you think that will be better?

446
00:48:09,850 --> 00:48:13,580
Yeah, let's do that.

447
00:48:19,330 --> 00:48:21,700
Oppa, you...

448
00:48:23,790 --> 00:48:27,730
you've just gotten your heart broken by me.

449
00:48:27,730 --> 00:48:30,670
Why don't you have any reaction?

450
00:48:32,100 --> 00:48:36,770
I just dumped you, okay?

451
00:48:36,770 --> 00:48:39,060
Do you think you are handsome or something?

452
00:48:39,060 --> 00:48:42,330
How are you handsome, in any way?

453
00:48:42,330 --> 00:48:46,160
Is there any handsome man who is so cold?

454
00:48:49,060 --> 00:48:51,260
Don't smile.

455
00:49:03,230 --> 00:49:08,230
If you see Unni,

456
00:49:09,810 --> 00:49:15,120
could you leave our house for a bit?

457
00:49:19,600 --> 00:49:22,860
If you leave and we meet again after a while,

458
00:49:24,960 --> 00:49:27,560
you'll seem more like a brother-in-law, right?

459
00:49:29,750 --> 00:49:33,400
Yes, I'll do that.

460
00:49:38,900 --> 00:49:40,920
I miss

461
00:49:43,250 --> 00:49:45,440
Eun Jo.

462
00:49:47,130 --> 00:49:51,770
Yeah, me too.

463
00:50:14,500 --> 00:50:19,030
Hey, why did you ask me to do such a thing?

464
00:50:19,030 --> 00:50:21,860
I'm sorry. You can get off work and go home.

465
00:50:21,860 --> 00:50:25,100
After I get back from the lab, I'll finish things up.

466
00:50:25,100 --> 00:50:28,580
Well, you don't have to do that.

467
00:50:28,580 --> 00:50:31,420
I'm good at organizing data.

468
00:50:31,420 --> 00:50:34,210
So, you can trust me and go home.

469
00:50:46,290 --> 00:50:47,930
Hello?

470
00:50:47,930 --> 00:50:50,300
Yes. This is Jeon Ho Seong from Mi Do Research Lab.

471
00:50:50,300 --> 00:50:53,630
Yes. How have you been?

472
00:50:58,140 --> 00:50:59,530
Yes, Hyo Seon.

473
00:50:59,530 --> 00:51:05,300
Oppa, after meeting with a buyer I stopped by a bookstore for a while.

474
00:51:05,300 --> 00:51:08,910
There's a short article about yeast published in a science magazine.

475
00:51:08,910 --> 00:51:11,790
The contributing writer doesn't have Unni's name,

476
00:51:11,790 --> 00:51:14,500
but no matter how much I think about it, it seems she wrote it.

477
00:51:14,500 --> 00:51:18,400
What is the title of the article? I'll look it up on my cell phone.

478
00:51:18,400 --> 00:51:20,390
Wait a moment, let me take a look at it.

479
00:51:23,140 --> 00:51:29,330
And Oppa, the name of the research lab is the same as the one we went to.

480
00:51:29,330 --> 00:51:32,360
What do you think has happened?

481
00:51:32,360 --> 00:51:35,870
Yes. This is Jeon Ho Seong from Mi Do Research Lab.

482
00:52:10,730 --> 00:52:12,370
Eun Jo!

483
00:52:18,930 --> 00:52:21,090
Eun Jo! Stop right there!

484
00:52:24,100 --> 00:52:27,260
Eun Jo, wait!

485
00:52:39,580 --> 00:52:41,450
Eun Jo!

486
00:53:45,030 --> 00:53:46,780
You...

487
00:53:49,210 --> 00:53:51,370
How could you...?

488
00:53:53,810 --> 00:53:56,450
I missed you so much.

489
00:53:58,190 --> 00:54:00,730
I looked for you

490
00:54:03,190 --> 00:54:05,980
like crazy, you brat.

491
00:54:09,500 --> 00:54:14,020
The fourth thing... What was it?

492
00:54:14,020 --> 00:54:15,530
What?

493
00:54:15,530 --> 00:54:18,140
The words you wanted to say to MMM.

494
00:54:19,320 --> 00:54:22,500
You told me only three of the four things.

495
00:54:23,140 --> 00:54:28,380
You said you would tell me the fourth thing after you return.

496
00:54:30,400 --> 00:54:32,700
You haven't told me yet.

497
00:54:33,620 --> 00:54:35,900
You want to hear it?

498
00:54:37,090 --> 00:54:42,930
I could've died never hearing it.

499
00:54:43,790 --> 00:54:48,860
I thought you got into an accident.

500
00:54:51,170 --> 00:54:55,840
What is the fourth thing?

501
00:54:56,460 --> 00:54:59,710
- What else could it be?
- Say it!

502
00:54:59,710 --> 00:55:02,030
Hurry up and say it!

503
00:55:02,030 --> 00:55:05,050
Say it before we die!

504
00:55:05,050 --> 00:55:07,130
I love you.

505
00:55:09,650 --> 00:55:12,320
You stupid brat.

506
00:55:14,560 --> 00:55:16,850
I said I love you.

507
00:56:16,030 --> 00:56:19,490
What's MMM?

508
00:56:19,490 --> 00:56:24,710
Mi Malo Muchacha. My stupid brat.

509
00:56:25,900 --> 00:56:29,900
Gyeonggi-do Opening Up the Republic of Korea's future

510
00:57:49,510 --> 00:57:52,090
Dae Seong True Winemakers

511
00:57:52,090 --> 00:57:57,020
Certificate of Award
Representative, Goo Eun Jo
Awarded for significant contribution to promoting our culture

512
00:58:33,150 --> 00:58:35,810
Don't you have anything to admit

513
00:58:37,850 --> 00:58:42,630
in front of Dad?

514
00:58:45,750 --> 00:58:51,940
Don't you know what I am asking you to admit?

515
00:58:55,600 --> 00:58:57,550
I...

516
00:59:01,510 --> 00:59:04,350
I missed you.

517
00:59:11,330 --> 00:59:13,220
What about you?

518
00:59:16,600 --> 00:59:18,580
I also...

519
00:59:24,220 --> 00:59:26,300
missed you.

